{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/1/931bb24d69a6f80a20769de5da9a65359dc29e80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1998}-2^{1997}-2^{1996}+2^{1995} = k \\cdot 2^{1995},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"300\" height=\"18\" /> what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a20cec11b7ba85efc84dca2a30f1f8e89aed1eb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/1012922e5e92ba8412520a114e822c7060653062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1998} - 2^{1997} - 2^{1996} + 2^{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Factor out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8faed1fba8f300a176daac8ae949374c5f6b58b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1995}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f004dd901d94b35b497c74236b5d385ba3e1e36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1995}(2^{3} - 2^{2} - 2^{1} + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Simplify:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60d07e0335ec441e766b700732378912da9d1b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1995}\\cdot (8 - 4 - 2 + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/7/587bd01ec0df22d9d8dd1dddb47a247048ce589e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1995}\\cdot (3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>By comparing the answer with the original equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359f43f0fd0ed3b672d389374aecd0360921a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c30566eb8cdc9bedece6cf3fe5e9f72d50b979e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Divide both sides of the original equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8faed1fba8f300a176daac8ae949374c5f6b58b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1995}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, giving:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec97d79b37d4c78c26fbfa048b8af5e0fce63bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 - 2^2 - 2^1 + 1 = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f96a3de68cfb881f4b3cc002ec222bba93f1e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a h